    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Bullet Hell Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge relentless waves of enemy fire, upgrade your abilities and unleash devastating attacks in fast-paced, high-intensity battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/308cfe30512841f76ce2d62a3556062b.poster.avif?t=1742903819\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/308cfe30512841f76ce2d62a3556062b.webm?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/308cfe30512841f76ce2d62a3556062b.mp4?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adopt Kitties to Activate Synergies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue abandoned Kitties and train them to assist the Invaders, boosting power and unlocking special perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/27ded08374159ec30afcacdf3e0f543b.poster.avif?t=1742903819\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/27ded08374159ec30afcacdf3e0f543b.webm?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/27ded08374159ec30afcacdf3e0f543b.mp4?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Unique Meows</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from multiple <strong>Parasites and Cats</strong> to fuse into a one-of-a-kind warrior, each with its own skills and mutations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/0c40f459ca809501f3c0398929e669a8.poster.avif?t=1742903819\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/0c40f459ca809501f3c0398929e669a8.webm?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/0c40f459ca809501f3c0398929e669a8.mp4?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolve Through Parasite Mutations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your Meows with game-changing abilities, unlocking devastating attacks and unpredictable evolutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/d7bb478fdbce8d061ff5d56b925cf2e1.poster.avif?t=1742903819\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/d7bb478fdbce8d061ff5d56b925cf2e1.webm?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/d7bb478fdbce8d061ff5d56b925cf2e1.mp4?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/f01fe370257194183e1a879069b7b787.poster.avif?t=1742903819\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/f01fe370257194183e1a879069b7b787.webm?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/f01fe370257194183e1a879069b7b787.mp4?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on cockroaches, mice, dogs, elite military forces, tanks, jets, and even <strong>humanity\u2019s last hope: nuclear strikes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/a9cd0248e2b6ff5a3917a7ad7fb9ce98.poster.avif?t=1742903819\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/a9cd0248e2b6ff5a3917a7ad7fb9ce98.webm?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/a9cd0248e2b6ff5a3917a7ad7fb9ce98.mp4?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will the <strong>Invaders</strong> wipe out humanity\u2026 or be stopped before total planetary domination? The war begins now!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Bullet Hell Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge relentless waves of enemy fire, upgrade your abilities and unleash devastating attacks in fast-paced, high-intensity battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/308cfe30512841f76ce2d62a3556062b.poster.avif?t=1742903819\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/308cfe30512841f76ce2d62a3556062b.webm?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/308cfe30512841f76ce2d62a3556062b.mp4?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adopt Kitties to Activate Synergies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue abandoned Kitties and train them to assist the Invaders, boosting power and unlocking special perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/27ded08374159ec30afcacdf3e0f543b.poster.avif?t=1742903819\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/27ded08374159ec30afcacdf3e0f543b.webm?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/27ded08374159ec30afcacdf3e0f543b.mp4?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Unique Meows</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from multiple <strong>Parasites and Cats</strong> to fuse into a one-of-a-kind warrior, each with its own skills and mutations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/0c40f459ca809501f3c0398929e669a8.poster.avif?t=1742903819\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/0c40f459ca809501f3c0398929e669a8.webm?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/0c40f459ca809501f3c0398929e669a8.mp4?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolve Through Parasite Mutations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your Meows with game-changing abilities, unlocking devastating attacks and unpredictable evolutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/d7bb478fdbce8d061ff5d56b925cf2e1.poster.avif?t=1742903819\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/d7bb478fdbce8d061ff5d56b925cf2e1.webm?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/d7bb478fdbce8d061ff5d56b925cf2e1.mp4?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/f01fe370257194183e1a879069b7b787.poster.avif?t=1742903819\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/f01fe370257194183e1a879069b7b787.webm?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/f01fe370257194183e1a879069b7b787.mp4?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on cockroaches, mice, dogs, elite military forces, tanks, jets, and even <strong>humanity\u2019s last hope: nuclear strikes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/a9cd0248e2b6ff5a3917a7ad7fb9ce98.poster.avif?t=1742903819\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/a9cd0248e2b6ff5a3917a7ad7fb9ce98.webm?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/a9cd0248e2b6ff5a3917a7ad7fb9ce98.mp4?t=1742903819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will the <strong>Invaders</strong> wipe out humanity\u2026 or be stopped before total planetary domination? The war begins now!</p>",
